hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1406","We have Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala, we have Sufyan, we have Al-Masudi, and Yahya is the Christian, on the authority of Abu Bakr, I said to Abdullah bin Abi Bakr: Hadith Yahya and Al-Masoudi told us, on the authority of your father, on the authority of Abbad bin Tamim, he said: I heard from Abbad bin Tamim, speaking to my father, on the authority of Abd Allah ibn Zayd said that the Prophet, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him, “went out to the prayer place and drew water, then he turned his cloak over and prayed two rak’ahs.”"
